            "napalm-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "winner_side": 0,
        "stipulation": "PWF Tag-team #1 Contenders Match",
        "note": "Billed T3 vs. the Hardcore Machines; only Ace Cooper is named performing for T3. Big Mama Sledge threw Ace Cooper a set of chains, which he used on Moon Glorious before hitting the BC Drop for the pin. Not a title match — winners earn the PWF Tag-team #1 contendership."
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "sides": [
          [
            "ambrose-fleetwood-pwf"
          ],
          [
            "toby-dirizzo-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "winner_side": 1,
        "stipulation": "Hardcore Match",
        "note": "Toby DiRizzo made Ambrose Fleetwood submit to the Screw the System in 26 seconds."
      },
      {
        "order": 3,
        "sides": [
          [
            "soniq-pwf"
          ],
          [
            "dark-cloak-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "winner_side": 0,
        "note": "Set up by a flashback to a PWF POWERHOUR angle in which the hooded Dark Cloak ambushed Soniq (billed \"Alecs Johnson\" in the ring text) on television. The arena lights cut out mid-match; when they returned, Dark Cloak had vanished and Soniq was alone in his own sleeperhold — the referee ruled Soniq the winner."
      },
      {
        "order": 4,
        "sides": [
          [
            "wolfgang-rainier-g-pwf"
          ],
          [
            "the-hatawman-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "result": "draw",
        "stipulation": "Mystery Match",
        "note": "Billed as a secret match between two returning PWF veterans. Jason Doods ran in with a lead pipe and knocked both men out before either could win; the referee counted both out and the semifinal status explicitly calls it a draw."
      },
      {
        "order": 5,
        "sides": [
          [
            "havoc-pwf"
          ],
          [
            "inferno-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "winner_side": 1,
        "stipulation": "The Revenge",
        "note": "Havoc, billed the former PWF champion, had been ambushed for weeks by an unidentified attacker revealed here as Inferno, who won with the Carnage Crush."
      },
      {
        "order": 6,
        "sides": [
          [
            "skanker-pwf"
          ],
          [
            "chris-cabana-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "winner_side": 1,
        "stipulation": "Hell in a Cell Match",
        "note": "Skanker challenged Cabana over Cabana flirting with his girlfriend, Two-Tone. Two visiting WWA wrestlers (billed \"the Miller Brothers\") climbed the cage as Skanker's apparent allies but turned on him instead, letting Cabana escape the cell for the win."
      },
      {
        "order": 7,
        "sides": [
          [
            "jason-doods-pwf"
          ],
          [
            "marcus-t-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "winner_side": 0,
        "stipulation": "First Blood Match",
        "note": "Referee Rick Strict ruled Marcus T. bled first after the timekeeper's bell was used on him. Marcus T. attacked Strict with the Run N Gun after the loss."
      },
      {
        "order": 8,
        "sides": [
          [
            "toby-dirizzo-pwf"
          ],
          [
            "soniq-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "winner_side": 1,
        "stipulation": "PWF World Title Tournament — Semifinal",
        "note": "Soniq took a steel chair from DiRizzo and used it on him before hitting the SoniqDown."
      },
      {
        "order": 9,
        "sides": [
          [
            "chris-cabana-pwf"
          ],
          [
            "inferno-pwf"
          ]
        ],
        "winner_side": 1,
        "stipulation": "PWF World Title Tournament — Semifinal",
        "note": "T3 intercepted the Miller Brothers before they could interfere again; Skanker returned the favor from earlier by chairing Cabana, and Inferno finished him with the Carnage Crush."
      },
      {
        "order": 10,
        "participants": [
          "soniq-pwf",
          "jason-doods-pwf",
          "inferno-pwf"
        ],
        "winner": "jason-doods-pwf",
        "stipulation": "Trio Ladder Match — PWF World Title",
        "note": "Havoc, ringside, cost Inferno the match by throwing a ladder into his face; Dark Cloak dragged Soniq out of the ring and out of the match entirely. Doods climbed the ladder alone to become the new and undisputed PWF World Champion."
      }
